{"id":"wb-8-300","name":"滁州无梁殿","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"滁州无梁殿","text":"无梁殿，原名玉皇殿，位于中国安徽省滁州市琅琊区琅琊山琅琊寺内，始建于后周，明初重建，占地面积156平方米，采砖石拱券结构，殿内无木梁，仅用砖柱14根。2019年被列为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%BB%81%E5%B7%9E%E6%97%A0%E6%A2%81%E6%AE%BF","revisionId":90607142,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90607142","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/818803519de88b6f610e9fe6.jpg","title":"Langyasi.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Langyasi.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/da/Langyasi.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Brookqi","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​安徽 琅琊山 琅琊寺 无梁殿","width":320,"height":212}}